# Zog, Triceraton Castaway {4}{R}: "When Zog enters, target creature can't block this turn." Any creature is a legal target, the
# controller's own included. On turn 3 Zog enters aimed at Bot1's own Grizzly Bears (accepted, where a Mox is refused), and the
# ability resolves. The effect ends with the turn: on turn 4 the Bears block Bot2's attacking Memnite and kill it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Grizzly Bears
Zog, Triceraton Castaway
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

